    "narrative": "The Austin Waves head into today\u2019s slate with **Kyle Tucker** serving as our primary anchor; his score of 78.68 is the highest on the team, bolstered by a juicy matchup against V\u00e1squez, whose 4.94 xERA suggests a prime environment for offensive output. **Josh Jung** (66.30) and **Andy Pages** (65.90) also present elite upside, with **Josh Jung** benefiting significantly from favorable park factors and **Andy Pages** finding leverage against a vulnerable pitcher. While **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** sits at a marginal 57.28, his strong xwOBA keeps him as a high-floor utility play, even against a tougher arm like Schlittler. We are leaning heavily into speed-based upside today to counteract our scarcity in the stolen base category, particularly through the aggressive baserunning potential of **Nasim Nunez** and **Sam Antonacci**.\n\nThe most difficult omission today was **Jackson Merrill**, who logged a 49.38 efficiency score. While he remains a core part of our long-term strategy, the presence of Ohtani on the mound forces a conservative approach; the 2.75 xERA penalty was simply too steep to justify a start over the higher-scoring options like **Gage Workman** or **Dominic Smith**. We are keeping a close watch on **Nolan Schanuel** and **Josh Lowe**; both carry 63.20 scores against Civale, though **Josh Lowe** carries a slight risk due to his lower batting order position, which traditionally suppresses run-scoring potential. \n\nWe must remain vigilant regarding the current status of **Jordan Westburg** and **Luis Robert Jr.**, who remain sidelined on the IL. Our bench depth\u2014featuring **Liam Hicks**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Drake Baldwin**, **Jorge Polanco**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Coby Mayo**, **Miguel Vargas**, and **Brady House**\u2014is being monitored for any shift in rotation, but for now, we are prioritizing the active efficiency scores provided by our starters. There are no major weather alerts impacting play, but given the delicate balance of our 5x5 Roto requirements, every plate appearance from **Gunnar Henderson** at the top of the order will be critical to maintaining our category trajectory.",
